@host = http://localhost:3000

### verificar saúde 

GET {{host}}/api/statusSaude

### buscar métricas 
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard

### busca faturas 
GET {{host}}/api/invoices

### buscar faturas pelo identificador
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/3

### criar faturas
POST {{host}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "amount": 125037,
    "status": "pending",
    "issueDate": "2026-10-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-10-31"
}


### alterar fatura


PUT {{host}}/api/invoices/226
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "amount": 125037,
    "status": "paid",
    "issueDate": "2026-10-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-10-31"

}
### deletar fatura
 DELETE '{{host}}/api/invoices/226

